{
  "id": "22087_sejou",
  "headword": "{施錠|せじょう}",
  "reading": "せじょう",
  "romaji": "sejou",
  "part_of_speech": "noun, suru verb",
  "gloss": "locking; securing a lock",
  "definitions": [
    {
      "sense_number": 1,
      "gloss": "locking; securing a lock",
      "explanation": "The act of locking a door, gate, or other opening. Used in formal and written contexts more than everyday speech."
    }
  ],
  "examples": [
    {
      "id": "22087_sejou_ex1",
      "japanese": "{施錠|せじょう}を{忘|わす}れた。",
      "english": "I forgot to lock up.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22087_sejou_ex2",
      "japanese": "{外出|がいしゅつ}する{前|まえ}に{施錠|せじょう}を{確認|かくにん}する。",
      "english": "I check that the door is locked before going out.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    },
    {
      "id": "22087_sejou_ex3",
      "japanese": "{閉店|へいてん}{後|ご}は{全|すべ}ての{出入口|でいりぐち}を{施錠|せじょう}してください。",
      "english": "Please lock all entrances after the store closes.",
      "sense_numbers": [
        1
      ],
      "has_audio": false,
      "notes": null
    }
  ],
  "notes": "A formal word for the act of locking. While {鍵|かぎ}をかける is the everyday expression for locking a door, {施錠|せじょう} is preferred in written notices, instructions, and formal speech.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {施錠|せじょう}する: to lock\n- {施錠|せじょう}を{確認|かくにん}する: to confirm the lock\n- {施錠|せじょう}を{忘|わす}れる: to forget to lock\n- {自動|じどう}{施錠|せじょう}: automatic locking\n- {施錠|せじょう}{管理|かんり}: lock management\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- {鍵|かぎ}をかける: to lock — the everyday colloquial expression\n- {解錠|かいじょう}: unlocking — the formal antonym of {施錠|せじょう}\n- {戸締|とじ}まり: locking up (the house) — focuses on securing the whole house before leaving or sleeping",
